ound files in there then you will be able to play them in-game and with their playlist photos aswell.\non first run it will put bad apple in there bc peak\n\nComplete feature list:\n\nCircular visualizer\nLocal sound files support\nLocal playlist photos support\nmobile + pc support\nsmooth ahh ui\ncustomizable\nsave between sessions\nopen sourced\n\nSettings:\n\n--// Rainbow Visualizer\n\n--// Reaction Mode(s)\n- Spectrum (accurate)\n- Loudness\n- Random\n\n--// Show Song Name\n--// Show Song Time\n\n--// UI Scale\n- 70% to 140%\n\n--// Custom volume (0.0 - 10.0)\n\n--// Sound Effects\n- Bass boost\n- Vocal boost\n- Treble boost\n- Warm\n- V shape\n- Lofi\n\n--// Play random song\n--// Hide , Hide bind\n--// Unload UI\n\n---- Tested on: Solara, Xeno, Madium, Real, Delta\n---- will not work on codex ( getcustomasset() )\n---- Faulty on xeno because xeno is silly and stupid, creates random folders (at least in my test.)","tags":["free","visualizer","open sourced","music player","keyless"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/ZPfWaw5Jxq","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"65748a1c06ff53dbd23f193e","username":"hi_hi_hi","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c0d5647a9ff0e09144312bc57ed1a54cb0a04f64906428f13b6ff9353bd215ca.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65748a1c06ff53dbd23f193e-1756906980027.png"},"lvl":15,"status":"offline","id":"65748a1c06ff53dbd23f193e","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"week","rank":11,"period":"week","metric":"likes","value":9}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.chart_topper","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c0d5647a9ff0e09144312bc57ed1a54cb0a04f64906428f13b6ff9353bd215ca.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65748a1c06ff53dbd23f193e-1756906980027.png"}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueSpeedDemon","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-05T13:37:42.306Z","profile":"/u/QueueSpeedDemon"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"working","pct":100,"conf":0.4,"n":{"